    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Spheres Are the Key </strong></h2>Use the spheres power to light the torches and complete the level. But it won't always be easy: you'll need to aim your throws well and launch them before the time limit runs out...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/6bfd91c45267f921833e6465346282ed.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/6bfd91c45267f921833e6465346282ed.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/6bfd91c45267f921833e6465346282ed.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Campaigns, Two stories</strong></h2>Uncover Enid's story as you recover the forgotten fragments, or team up with a friend to unravel all the secrets of the two-player campaign. Each campaign has its own levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090//extras/Coop.gif?t=1753701578\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Over 120 Levels to Conquer</strong></h2>Each campaign features 4 worlds to explore, with over 60 levels each. But the challenge doesn't end there, as you can replay each level to improve your time and become the best!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/7eb049d83656010b7f2b5d994a50ac18.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/7eb049d83656010b7f2b5d994a50ac18.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/7eb049d83656010b7f2b5d994a50ac18.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Boss Fights!</strong></h2>At the end of each world, you'll face a powerful boss, each with their own unique mechanics. Get ready to apply everything you've learned during your adventure to emerge victorious in these battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/aef3d5cac656b0b66636c549e29dc44a.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/aef3d5cac656b0b66636c549e29dc44a.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/aef3d5cac656b0b66636c549e29dc44a.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find the hidden collectibles and the secret levels!</strong></h2>Find the hidden collectibles in some levels to unlock skins and customize your characters. Make sure to explore every corner: to play the secret levels, you'll need to light special torches...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/c759075eb8013d59888733390e5e6d57.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/c759075eb8013d59888733390e5e6d57.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/c759075eb8013d59888733390e5e6d57.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/3aeb9b7e492bf8bf9f31d59d6545f63d.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/3aeb9b7e492bf8bf9f31d59d6545f63d.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/3aeb9b7e492bf8bf9f31d59d6545f63d.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/f179b426c475802529b9f62425fcdf02.poster.avif?t=1753701578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/f179b426c475802529b9f62425fcdf02.webm?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492090/extras/f179b426c475802529b9f62425fcdf02.mp4?t=1753701578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
